## Why I picked this topic

UPI fraud is everywhere right now — almost everyone I know has either been targeted or knows someone who was. It's also one of those crimes where the victim often gets blamed for "not being careful enough," which I think is unfair. The scams are genuinely well-designed. Understanding how they work is the first step to not falling for them.

