| Law | What it covers |
|-----|---------------|
| IT Act 2000, Section 66D | Cheating by impersonation using digital means — up to 3 years imprisonment |
| IPC Section 420 | Cheating and dishonestly inducing delivery of property |
| IPC Section 419 | Cheating by personation |
| RBI Guidelines | Zero liability for customer if fraud is reported within 3 working days |

