## How to report if it happens

1. Call your bank immediately — ask them to raise a dispute on the transaction
2. File a complaint at [cybercrime.gov.in](https://cybercrime.gov.in)
3. Call the National Cyber Crime Helpline: **1930**
4. File an FIR at your nearest police station
5. Report the number/UPI ID to your payment app

Don't wait. The faster you report, the better the chance of any recovery.

